    "body": "ZORR MODE\n\nSCOPE = NON-ARCHIVE ONLY\nDO_NOT_TOUCH = issue #204 archive work / zb-archive-v1 / Permanent Archive implementation\nTARGET_REPO = Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-local-executor\nCURRENT_TARGET_MAIN = 840e6c6f6904f606fedbe6daad1063654130b4f9\n\nPROBLEM = private local-executor main is unprotected while self-hosted HOME-PC workflows can use local owner gh authentication.\nFRESH_EVIDENCE = branches/main protected=false. Repository rulesets API for this private repo returns 403: Upgrade to GitHub Pro or make this repository public.\n\nREUSE_FIRST = native GitHub branch protection / existing official gh CLI / existing HOME-PC-BABYLON runner only.\nNEW_BACKUP = NO\nARCHIVE_MUTATION = NO\nNEW_DAEMON = NO\nNEW_RUNNER = NO\nPROPRIETARY_NEW_DEPENDENCY = NO\n\nGATE 1 = disposable PR capability probe for legacy branch protection via owner gh; no main mutation.\nGATE 2 = if native protection is available, enforce it and verify. If paid-plan blocked, do not fake protection; remove/disable persistent privileged execution from unprotected main using the smallest safe existing-path change.\n\nPASS requires fresh physical evidence for the selected security state and exact durable record here. No PASS by prose.",
